This repository has two parts with different terms.

1. Prompt text
   The prompt text in README.md, README.zh.md, prompts/ and data/prompts.json is
   dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
   You may copy, modify and use it for any purpose, without asking and without credit.
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

2. Images (everything under images/)
   The images are sample outputs and sample input photos from the public examples
   published by image2ai. They are included here only to show what each prompt
   produced. They are NOT covered by CC0, and this repository does not grant any
   license to reuse them. To make your own version, run the prompt yourself.

The images are AI-generated. No guarantee is made that they qualify for copyright
protection, or that outputs you generate from these prompts will look the same.
Product and label names that appear in the images (for example "PEAKLINE" and
"VERDA") are made up for the samples and do not refer to real brands.
